{"id":382,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"真理の探究を掲げる桜修館の6年教育","feature_description":"東京都立桜修館中等教育学校は、「真理の探究」を掲げ、高い知性・広い視野・強い意志を育てる学校です。生徒が自ら考え企画する学校行事や、6年間の時間を生かした進路指導が特徴です。特色ある教育活動では論理的な思考力も育て、部活動も活発です。中学1年から高校3年までの流れの中で、自分で学びを組み立てやすい環境があります。学びと行事の両面から成長できます。","clubs":[{"id":7078,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/oshukan-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7079,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/oshukan-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7080,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/oshukan-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7081,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/oshukan-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7082,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/oshukan-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7083,"name":"男子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/oshukan-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7084,"name":"女子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/oshukan-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7085,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/oshukan-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7086,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/oshukan-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7087,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/oshukan-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7088,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/oshukan-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7089,"name":"弓道部","category":"運